1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,359
Every repair feels like progress, until the same pump fails again.

2
00:00:04,409 --> 00:00:10,335
RCA Pilot helps your team find the real cause, fix it, and prove it stays fixed.

3
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:12,950
Here it is, on a slurry pump.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,392
Start with the problem.

5
00:00:15,442 --> 00:00:20,529
Pump P-101 has failed six times in twelve months, and each failure stops the line for fourteen hours.

6
00:00:20,579 --> 00:00:26,808
Add the downtime, margin and repair cost, and RCA Pilot shows the loss: about two hundred and thirty-eight thousand dollars a year.

7
00:00:26,858 --> 00:00:27,950
These figures are illustrative.

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,705
Next, the evidence.

9
00:00:30,755 --> 00:00:38,950
Add photos, trend data, inspections and records, so every cause can be checked against facts, not opinions.

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,185
Then the cause tree.

11
00:00:42,235 --> 00:00:47,505
Physical, human and system causes, marked as natural or forced deterioration.

12
00:00:47,555 --> 00:00:56,695
Under Suggestions, the cause coach proposes causes you may have missed, and Challenge my analysis points out weak links.

13
00:00:56,745 --> 00:01:01,532
You read each one, then accept it or dismiss it.

14
00:01:01,582 --> 00:01:02,983
The AI suggests.

15
00:01:03,033 --> 00:01:03,950
You decide.

16
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:06,100
Now actions.

17
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:12,900
Each root cause gets a corrective or preventive action, with an owner and a due date.

18
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:18,425
Change the maintenance plan, with the new inspection interval, and list the spares.

19
00:01:18,475 --> 00:01:23,950
AI can suggest actions too, but nothing is added until you accept it.

20
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:26,772
After the fix, verify.

21
00:01:26,822 --> 00:01:32,100
Savings only count once someone has checked that the failure has stopped coming back.

22
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:38,950
Then roll the fix out to similar assets, so the next pump does not fail the same way.

23
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:44,789
When you are ready, let the AI draft a one-page management summary.

24
00:01:44,839 --> 00:01:48,950
You edit it, then print or save it as a PDF.

25
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,950
RCA Pilot keeps the whole investigation in one place.

26
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,050
The AI suggests, and your people decide.

27
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:58,950
Try it at www.rcapilot.com.

